     The lliibbeeffiivvaarr library implements access to EFI Variables via the EFI Run‐
     time Services.  All _c_h_a_r _* strings are converted to 16-bit UTF strings
     before passing them to EFI.

     eeffii__vvaarriiaabblleess__ssuuppppoorrtteedd() returns non-zero if the current machine sup‐
     ports setting of EFI firmware variables and the kernel support for doing
     so is present.  Otherwise zero is returned.

